  "description": "Ina reunites with Choi Dongha, a man she once loved—now a VIP she can’t easily push away. After returning from a long stay abroad, Dongha proposes a partnership, while Ina struggles to hide her lingering feelings and maintain a dangerously fragile boundary. As their risky reunion deepens, the question remains: how will it end?\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12145048), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12734405) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13705384), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297088067), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/TheAffairofDongha), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000076603), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260141), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69157773), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=261l), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=0hnr), Toon365, ZzangComic, [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H049220590), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H049220590), [Aladin](https://www.aladin.co.kr/shop/wproduct.aspx?ItemId=388013623), [KyoboBook](https://ebook-product.kyobobook.co.kr/dig/epd/ebook/E000012622618), [Yes24](https://www.yes24.com/product/goods/182184662)",
